@startuml ch5-state-object
' F5.18 Life of one object instance: each state is one StateRun, each transition one event.
' Verified against: src/aegis/memory/runs.py (_segments, build_state_runs, _event_type),
' src/aegis/memory/ingest.py (_ingest_runs: extend vs moved_while_unobserved),
' src/aegis/core/config.py (MemoryBuildConfig: min_observations=2,
' min_run_observations=2, trailing_single_confidence=0.5)
!include _aegis_style.iuml
!pragma layout smetana
scale 1.35

skinparam StateBackgroundColor $MB_FILL
skinparam StateBorderColor $MB_BORDER
skinparam StateBorderThickness 1.2
skinparam StateFontStyle bold
skinparam StateAttributeFontSize 12
skinparam StateAttributeFontStyle plain

state Placed : relation to an anchor:\ninside, on_surface, under, above,\nnext_to, on_floor, near\nor in_room (no anchor)
state Carried : carried_by_user
state "Out of view" as Away #F1F3F5;line:6B7785 : last-known state kept\n(object permanence)

[*] --> Placed : seen in 2+ frames\n/ new instance
Placed --> Carried : pickup
Carried --> Placed : placement
Placed --> Placed : anchor_change (other anchor)\nstate_change (same anchor)
Placed --> Away : leaves view\n(no event)
Away --> Placed : next session, same place\n/ extend last run
Away --> Placed : next session, elsewhere\n/ moved_while_unobserved

note "A new state starts only after 2 frames in a row agree\n(or 1 final frame with confidence ≥ 0.5)." as N1
@enduml
